===================================================================
Python 3.8.18 for Tru64 UNIX V5.1B - Binary Package
Target: alphaev56-dec-osf5.1b
===================================================================
1. DESCRIPTION
   This package contains Python 3.8.18 built natively for
   Tru64 UNIX V5.1B on DEC Alpha EV56 using GCC 4.7.4.
   To work around dynamic extension loading issues encountered
   on OSF/1, key C extensions are statically embedded into the
   Python executable.
   Statically built-in modules include:
     - _ssl (OpenSSL 1.1.1)
     - hashlib support (MD5, SHA-1, SHA-2, SHA-3 and BLAKE2)
     - pyexpat
     - zlib
     - _socket, select
     - _json, _csv, _struct
     - _datetime, _pickle, _asyncio
     - math, cmath, unicodedata
     - and additional core modules
2. EXTRACT AND INSTALL
   Run the following commands as root to extract the package
   into /usr/local:
     # cd /usr/local
     # gzip -dc /path/to/Tru64_Python_3.8.18_static.tar.gz \
         | /sbin/tar xvf -
3. ENVIRONMENT SETUP
   Add the following lines to .profile:
     export PATH=/usr/local/bin:$PATH
     export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/lib:/usr/local/ssl/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH
4. VERIFICATION
   Basic version check:
     # /usr/local/bin/python3 -V
   Installed environment verification:
     # /usr/local/bin/python3 -c "
     import sys, ssl, hashlib, pyexpat
     print('Python:', sys.version.split()[0])
     print('OpenSSL:', ssl.OPENSSL_VERSION)
     print('SHA256:', hashlib.sha256(b'Tru64').hexdigest())
     print('pyexpat:', pyexpat.__name__)
     print('=== INSTALL VERIFIED ===')
     " && /usr/local/bin/pip3 --version
   Verified output:
     Python: 3.8.18
     OpenSSL: OpenSSL 1.1.1  11 Sep 2018
     SHA256: 50b8bbb3bdbe5d316ad31082c5cd5d74f86430ffe0e396bdb08c69d73ad5fee4
     pyexpat: pyexpat
     === INSTALL VERIFIED ===
     pip 23.0.1 from /usr/local/lib/python3.8/site-packages/pip (python 3.8)
5. ADDITIONAL VERIFIED FUNCTIONALITY
   The installed interpreter was also verified with:
     - Core statically linked module imports
     - zlib compression and decompression
     - SSLContext creation using OpenSSL 1.1.1
     - HTTPS access using urllib.request
     - CA certificate verification using:
         /usr/local/share/cacert.pem
     - HTTPS response from www.google.com:
         HTTP 200
         100 bytes received
6. KNOWN LIMITATIONS
   This is a platform-specific static-core build for Tru64 UNIX.
   It is not intended to provide every optional CPython extension.
   Dynamic extension loading may fail with:
     dlopen: Cannot map library
   Applications requiring unavailable optional extensions may need
   additional porting or static integration.
===================================================================
